{
  "description": "Reviewed Korean for mixed/Japanese residual aux targets, batch 008 (bank 5D pilot battle voice). Leading glyphs are speaker/portrait bytes, so the Korean covers the spoken line only. A few records are mid-word continuations of the previous line and are translated to read on from it.",
